    "detailed_description": "<strong><u>ULTRAFUN</u></strong> is a game about patience, rewards, and goals.<br><br>...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983520/extras/a2dc5fec0f845a24a483487a6ffa1d55.poster.avif?t=1696137675\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983520/extras/a2dc5fec0f845a24a483487a6ffa1d55.webm?t=1696137675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983520/extras/a2dc5fec0f845a24a483487a6ffa1d55.mp4?t=1696137675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Take care of the last remaining fragment of <strong>Planet Ky</strong>, a world obliterated long ago by the <strong>Greater Void</strong> lying within. <br><br><strong>The Kyzt</strong>, in a last-ditch effort to tether itself to our world, formed into one Kyztling: <br><br><i>    ... Qubert. </i><br><br>A renowned scientist, you must help Qubert to restore the ecological balance of Planet Ky, and to eventually <strong>reconnect your species with the Intergalactic Federation</strong>.<br><br><strong>Relax</strong>. You've got this. This is all you have to do:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <i><strong>Feed</strong> your scientists some delicious and <strong>ethically-sourced</strong> Voidling cuisine!</i><br></li><li> <i><strong>Channel</strong> your progress into the psychic relay, a natural and vaguely tree-like organism growing within the Ky Fragment. <br></i></li><li> <i><strong>Make friends</strong> with your Kyztlings. To be clear, this is not a multiplayer game. I am talking about virtual friends.<br></i></li><li> <i><strong>Realize</strong> that this game challenges you beyond the limits of any lesser game. Are you gamer enough to attain <strong>GAMER VALHALLA</strong>?</i>.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983520/extras/9b86ab9bb7ef48672e0914616d058c6a.avif?t=1696137675\" /></div><br><br><strong>That's right.</strong><br><br>If you download &amp; play this game, I will personally send you to <strong>GAMER VALHALLA</strong>. I'm the developer and I am allowed to send you there. Buckle up, because you're going to be sent there at an extremely high velocity. Wear a helmet.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join the Discord!</strong> </h2>",
